{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1e9b4a1f8073d7f2ea1b51736a8a23674daacae454333973dc5e4ea907efed5d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13b1b08734c3a210c208f405337b09611db399d8c7d52d7028ac82ffb406a92c","slc_25b892612fa07d9ab428695556f97df5f93cf02edb80e8d2d6a6c48f7dc85f98"],"source_ids":["src_df0dc25607b7544aa3ee6644fc12c916","src_fe8852d28e9b56cea0a9ad29279b9d6d"],"text":"The runtime offers four permission modes (default, autoEdit, plan, yolo); Shift+Tab cycles the first three in the TUI, while yolo requires an explicit command, launch argument, or setting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_31614ee8d45f114e1f5cfd704bfde4cf8aff960ddd190bad2d3339953db9b9e9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9b79e93f0f7c4c0e717499aaf105ff83c4885d4b5344d6646335287a1bea95c0","slc_a6b864c74ed801d8457fe1cbd9aa4f34711f2d493ca3f90bcd5ce5fdc5c471db"],"source_ids":["src_2b5525f8934e5d8b945a1f1bfec523ef"],"text":"The product ships as an interactive CLI ('blade'), a Web UI ('blade web'), a headless HTTP server ('blade serve'), non-interactive modes '--headless' with JSONL output, and a single-turn '--print' mode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_54af29809cd6886c86c2654963fe36ffaa75e34b4d862fbcb7bdf9d231fc959c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6749bc0e684261eb8a2f44d3a377d561b6c4336e75bb9610ab45ba8a4f3da0d9","slc_9e59da957f1948b33bb1123881e1ec247185b65834b9fb959cbad35745f52691","slc_afa00942871e26fc0e0cf46ba041514c59c9a5366c167a4ba66fcb0876ad1f23"],"source_ids":["src_367e908a67f15cbf9b8c3462e4d9ac24","src_bd9b198b1aca52ed96cced069c44a445"],"text":"Full compaction extracts explicitly marked entries (remember:, convention:, lesson:, fixed:) into topic files, capped at 20 entries, 500 code points each, 8,000 total, with deduplication, in-process and file locks, atomic replacement, and 0600 permissions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_56362f1b1d86421c033df958698df75f390bad0c74f09e68a7484887539641ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9bad4efe5cd601aacf9c227cbb7f7f82d60955146c55a993fdfc0a768dd463f2"],"source_ids":["src_2b5525f8934e5d8b945a1f1bfec523ef"],"text":"In-session slash commands include /model add and /model switch, /cost, /compact, /btw for side questions, /memory list, /tasks, and /goal to start Goal mode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_688557c894870f0a0af1d0b7298c49ddf2b214c57287e5eacd675ecb1a47a8b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_55926d16c13e55839ad59b2a15a6b23f746fc610ba4eeb8755f05a16052435f7","slc_8a9e1adfab824b84c8f7d609595dc818a07abc198267d312229a37166033e0a8","slc_958d41cd197aece014c574d693e4364b776cdf79a0c4f7918244942212b6c995"],"source_ids":["src_df0dc25607b7544aa3ee6644fc12c916"],"text":"A maxTurns setting caps model rounds (0 disables, -1 unlimited, N>0 limits); recovery paths such as output-length correction, Stop hooks, and mid-turn input cannot bypass it, and non-interactive callers without a continuation callback receive max_turns_exceeded.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8d60816fe7a3c7c586d50d095029cd8d434adea918445aa4b9662b93ee352a5d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22226423cf9b3fd4eefcd8ace574cd91ebafe71ab74b8e49fd0a8f5c86625d81"],"source_ids":["src_2b5525f8934e5d8b945a1f1bfec523ef"],"text":"The repository layout places the agent core and execution loop in packages/cli/src/agent, the pi-ai adapter in services/pi, a TypeBox-based tool system, a Hono web server, and a React+Vite web UI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_94b1a84daf77ef3fbb376bb8c700084eb42cd3f20287f81060ee0ad603def074","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f69e02ec206f6618e27f6a2b05a420357427d4a48623b97a109d5d5f0b1a854","slc_516f3684e262bfaac7993c9d51097719cd51a90dc8d2cfa2e40a2796f78ded77"],"source_ids":["src_367e908a67f15cbf9b8c3462e4d9ac24","src_bd9b198b1aca52ed96cced069c44a445"],"text":"Memory safety mechanisms include rejecting credential-like content (password, token, sk-*, AWS key IDs, PEM headers), forbidding '..' or '/' in topic names, and content-free projections so TUI/Web/ACP/Headless receive only outcome, entry count, and topic names.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_976351d3841cf1ad125995382e27520cf79dcf3f83d8ece9dde30b8470177012","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_680047a490a593467183867f5091203e536362b7991e41fc4e42c2401d3824d7","slc_6a680afb5227024c0902ec735bffb60db241f67a73b9b995280f3bc06f6ed6a6"],"source_ids":["src_367e908a67f15cbf9b8c3462e4d9ac24","src_bd9b198b1aca52ed96cced069c44a445"],"text":"Memory files live under ~/.blade/projects/{escaped-path}/memory/ with per-project isolation, containing a MEMORY.md index plus topic files such as patterns.md, debugging.md, and architecture.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9dc05de35934eee74b658c016c9fba0b0203167a8f5ae3bc948454c1814ce0c9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37ad4cbbb0f2b1844a5d070db810c1437edeb9a89094e2de4d8b28e7eaa06b56","slc_b0d4b8908d13b92c609585c3ac9bce2f72ea9e4a7b5b8b81af63263b1021ad54"],"source_ids":["src_2b5525f8934e5d8b945a1f1bfec523ef"],"text":"The runtime uses the pi-ai library to unify 38+ model providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, Google, Bedrock) with model metadata fetched dynamically from the pi-ai catalog.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b6afab1e67a0dbdef4bb09a92a7b3dad69c815b14b93c8d8e84b2fe246e4f4a2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"echovic/blade-code@8917e4e0ef61 snapshot 4784f9b274c8ce01","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_07fe1d21c7b2793efb2135256c43e367880a21ba57132b5c6629dff6b256c7bf","slc_3bfe40a914ed313e754541bba1449940a8847927f879b0cd6ba611ff38ff5f04","slc_536490193ea108444b66bf92002cb857180b7da3ff5d409ab325e94041d0bbef","slc_6f4ae478f37db9bc6226d352a325d9a6dfeed7419b296567fe485c1c251eb2f5"],"source_ids":["src_df0dc25607b7544aa3ee6644fc12c916"],"text":"Permission rules use Tool(param:value) syntax with picomatch * and ** wildcards, evaluated in order deny > allow > ask > default (ask), covering file paths, Bash commands, and WebFetch/WebSearch URL patterns.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d1d1df53de7d4ab4906945f62e3560fe"}
